+
+// bc: the BC block as four little-endian words (BC1 uses words 0..1). kind: 1 = BC1 RGBA, 2 = BC2, 3 = BC3, 4 = BC1 RGB. out: the ASTC block as four words (zeroed here).
+BCA_FN u32 bca_transcode(BCA_T const u32 *bc, u32 kind, BCA_T u32 *out) {
